  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "V01",
      "at": 1.0,
      "text": "So you want to learn something."
    },
    {
      "id": "V02",
      "at": 6.0,
      "text": "YouTube has the answer. Somewhere. In one of four million videos.",
      "maxPause": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "V03",
      "at": 11.0,
      "text": "Good luck."
    },
    {
      "id": "V04",
      "at": 13.0,
      "text": "Vortex takes the best teaching on YouTube and puts it in order."
    },
    {
      "id": "V05",
      "at": 19.0,
      "text": "Real courses, lesson by lesson, with every creator credited."
    },
    {
      "id": "V06",
      "at": 27.0,
      "text": "Stuck on something? Just ask, in plain English."
    },
    {
      "id": "V07",
      "at": 33.0,
      "text": "Vortex finds the lesson, and the exact moment it's explained."
    },
    {
      "id": "V08",
      "at": 40.0,
      "text": "Life happens. Dinner's ready. The dog needs a walk."
    },
    {
      "id": "V09",
      "at": 46.0,
      "text": "Come back whenever. Your place is saved to the second."
    },
    {
      "id": "V10",
      "at": 53.0,
      "text": "When a video ends, a quick quiz checks what actually stuck."
    },
    {
      "id": "V11",
      "at": 59.0,
      "text": "Missed a few? Retake it until you've got it."
    },
    {
      "id": "V12",
      "at": 66.0,
      "text": "And for anything that isn't a course yet, describe your goal."
    },
    {
      "id": "V13",
      "at": 71.0,
      "text": "Sourdough, say. Vortex builds you a plan, one video at a time."
    },
    {
      "id": "V14",
      "at": 80.0,
      "text": "Vortex."
    },
    {
      "id": "V15",
      "at": 82.0,
      "text": "Learn anything, the way a course teaches it."
    }
  ],
